# Soundcharts credentials for the live P2 harvest (T062).
#
# HOW TO USE (your real key NEVER goes on GitHub):
#   1. Copy this file to the gitignored location:
#        cp music_dataset_generator/soundcharts.env.example generation_workspace/soundcharts.env
#      (the whole generation_workspace/ tree is gitignored, so that copy can never be committed)
#   2. Fill in your real credentials in generation_workspace/soundcharts.env.
#   3. Run the live commands normally — the CLI reads them automatically.
#
# Do NOT put real credentials in THIS file — this .example template IS committed.
# An explicit `export …` in your shell always overrides the file.

# --- Option A: OAuth client-credentials (RECOMMENDED; new Soundcharts scheme) ---
# From your Soundcharts dashboard: "Client ID" + "Client Secret".
SOUNDCHARTS_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here
SOUNDCHARTS_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret-here
# SOUNDCHARTS_TEAM_ID=optional-team-id   # only if your account requires a team

# --- Option B: Legacy API key (also the public sandbox: soundcharts / soundcharts) ---
# Uncomment and use these INSTEAD of the OAuth pair if your account uses the legacy scheme.
# SOUNDCHARTS_APP_ID=your-app-id-here
# SOUNDCHARTS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
